        "text": "Page: 67th Venice International Film Festival. Sentence: The 67th annual Venice International Film Festival held in Venice, Italy, took place from 1 to 11 September 2010.\nPage: 67th Venice International Film Festival. Sentence: The opening film was Darren Aronofsky's \"Black Swan\".\nPage: Black Swan (film). Sentence: It stars Natalie Portman, Vincent Cassel, Mila Kunis, Barbara Hershey and Winona Ryder.\nPage: Post Mortem (2010 film). Sentence: The film competed in the 67th Venice International Film Festival, Antofagasta Film Festival, Havana Film Festival and the Guadalajara International Film Festival.\nPage: Scott Franklin. Sentence: He is an Oscar nominee for his work on Black Swan and a two time recipient of the Independent Spirit Award for Best Picture.",
